        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-11-05T18:07:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have been using Zephyr style for the Zephyr shim. Neither option is really that great in the platform/ec repository.\n\nI honestly prefer always having {}. I thinking it avoids coding errors.",
      "parentUuid": "2ba1d6b9_4bd04d63",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 100,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 100,
